sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SU as setup_single_controller
  participant VG as VllmGeneration
  participant RT as ManagedDynamoRuntime
  participant WK as vLLM workers (per DP leader)
  participant DWk as Dynamo Worker task
  participant WS as CollectiveWeightSynchronizer
  SU->>VG: build (backend: vllm, dynamo: true)
  VG->>RT: start() → etcd, NATS, dynamo.frontend (workers' venv)
  VG->>WK: build worker group exactly as native (+ kv_events_config, SnapshotStatLogger)
  loop each DP leader
    VG->>WK: start_dynamo_endpoint_async(namespace, engine_env)
    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
    WK->>DWk: ★ start_dynamo_endpoint(DynamoVllmAdapter(host))<br/>→ Worker(adapter, config).run() on the actor loop
    end
    DWk->>RT: register in etcd (component backend / endpoint generate)
  end
  VG->>RT: wait_for_engines(dp_size): /health instances + model on /v1/models
  Note over VG,RT: every poll also asks each leader dynamo_endpoint_error()
  SU->>WS: init_communicator → native NCCL group (unchanged)
